# PC card pc-melee-ogi (docs/plan-melee-top5.md, MGUN-13 on the banked gun, BENCH-118): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 8 seeds (3197-3204, after the power card's 3191-3196), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant. Template: ogiprep writes work/melee-ogi-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, po); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
